{
  "name": "Daily Content Ideas (Ollama — local test)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily Content Ideas — Ollama local-test variant\n\nSelf-contained version of `daily_content_ideas_ollama.json`: no Supabase, no Google Sheets, no API keys.\n\nSwaps vs. the Supabase version:\n- Supabase Insert/Query → In-Memory Vector Store (n8n built-in; persists across runs in-process)\n- Google Sheets Append → Write Binary File (saves to C:\\Users\\Administrator\\Desktop\\content_ideas_log.json)\n- Slack alert node → removed\n- Chat model: `llama3.1` via Ollama; Embeddings: `nomic-embed-text` via Ollama\n\n**Design note:** the insert chain is a *separate terminal branch* of the Webhook Trigger (v1 execution order runs it before the agent branch). Do not chain Insert -> Agent: the insert node emits one item per chunk, so the agent would run once per chunk.\n\nPrerequisites:\n1. Ollama running locally on port 11434 — credential Base URL must be `http://127.0.0.1:11434` (n8n's fetch does not fall back from IPv6 `::1`)\n2. `ollama pull llama3.1`\n3. `ollama pull nomic-embed-text`\n4. n8n started with `N8N_RESTRICT_FILE_ACCESS_TO` pointing at the output folder (n8n 2.x blocks writes outside `~/.n8n-files` otherwise)\n\nTest with (production webhook; double-encoded space in the node name):\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:5678/webhook/<WORKFLOW_ID>/webhook%2520trigger/daily-content-ideas-ollama-local\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\\\"topic\\\": \\\"sustainable gardening for beginners\\\", \\\"sessionId\\\": \\\"test-1\\\"}\"",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "f0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-480, -340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "daily-content-ideas-ollama-local"
      },
      "id": "f0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-300, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chunkSize": 400,
        "chunkOverlap": 40
      },
      "id": "f0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Text Splitter",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.textSplitterCharacterTextSplitter",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-130, 160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "dataType": "json",
        "jsonMode": "allInputData",
        "textSplittingMode": "custom"
      },
      "id": "f0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Document Loader",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.documentDefaultDataLoader",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [70, 160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "nomic-embed-text",
        "baseUrl": "http://localhost:11434"
      },
      "id": "f0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "Embeddings",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsOllama",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [70, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "ollamaApi": {
          "id": "OLLAMA_API",
          "name": "Ollama (local)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert"
      },
      "id": "f0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
      "name": "Vector Store Insert",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreInMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [290, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "retrieve-as-tool",
        "toolName": "recent_content_ideas",
        "toolDescription": "Retrieves previously generated content ideas so duplicates can be avoided"
      },
      "id": "f0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
      "name": "Vector Store Query",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreInMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [290, -180],
      "credentials": {
        "ollamaApi": {
          "id": "OLLAMA_API",
          "name": "Ollama (local)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Webhook Trigger').first().json.body.sessionId || $execution.id }}"
      },
      "id": "f0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000008",
      "name": "Window Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [470, -40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "llama3.1",
        "baseUrl": "http://localhost:11434",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000009",
      "name": "Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [470, -340],
      "credentials": {
        "ollamaApi": {
          "id": "OLLAMA_API",
          "name": "Ollama (local)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "agent": "toolsAgent",
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $('Webhook Trigger').first().json.body.topic || $('Webhook Trigger').first().json.topic || 'sustainable gardening for beginners' }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a content strategist. Generate unique, actionable content ideas for the topic provided. Use the recent_content_ideas tool to check previously generated ideas and avoid duplicating them. Format output as a numbered list with the content format in brackets."
        }
      },
      "id": "f0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
      "name": "RAG Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [720, -40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toJson",
        "mode": "each",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "content_ideas.json",
          "format": true
        }
      },
      "id": "f0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000011",
      "name": "Convert Agent Output to JSON File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [820, -40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fileName": "C:\\Users\\Administrator\\Desktop\\content_ideas_log.json",
        "options": {
          "append": true
        }
      },
      "id": "f0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000012",
      "name": "Save to File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.writeBinaryFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [930, -40]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Vector Store Insert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "RAG Agent",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Text Splitter": {
      "ai_textSplitter": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Document Loader",
            "type": "ai_textSplitter",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Document Loader": {
      "ai_document": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Vector Store Insert",
            "type": "ai_document",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Embeddings": {
      "ai_embedding": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Vector Store Insert",
            "type": "ai_embedding",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Vector Store Query",
            "type": "ai_embedding",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Vector Store Query": {
      "ai_tool": [
        [
          {
            "node": "RAG Agent",
            "type": "ai_tool",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Window Memory": {
      "ai_memory": [
        [
          {
            "node": "RAG Agent",
            "type": "ai_memory",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Chat Model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "RAG Agent",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "RAG Agent": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Convert Agent Output to JSON File",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Convert Agent Output to JSON File": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Save to File",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "triggerCount": 1
}
